{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53389","headline":"送空海上人朝谒後归日本 · 朱少端","name":"送空海上人朝谒後归日本","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禅客祖州来，中华谒帝回。\n腾空犹振锡，过海来浮杯。\n佛法逢人授，天书到国开。\n归程数万里，归国信悠哉。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱少端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}